Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 11:42:03 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Features: more row content, cards rows and a dark tone

Rows take stats, quote, and points as { title, text }. layout: 'cards'
renders a split heading over a grid of cards. tone: 'dark' works per row
(full-bleed) or per module, with an optional --on-dark token. Grid cards
gain label, points and image icons.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
