 ## [Unreleased]
 
 ### Added
+- **Features: more row content, cards rows and a dark tone.** Rows take
+  `stats`, `quote`, and `points` as `{ title, text }` as well as strings.
+  `layout: 'cards'` turns a row into a split heading over a grid of cards
+  (numbered labels, icons, bullet lists pinned to the bottom, optional CTA).
+  `tone: 'dark'` works per row (full-bleed band) or on the whole module, with
+  an optional `--on-dark` text token. Grid cards gain `label`, `points` and
+  image icons. Existing configs render as before.
 - **Media: video, audio and PDFs.** Native players with no library
   (`components/media/`). Files go in the new `src/assets/media/` folder (copied
   to the build with a content hash, never inlined), or use a full URL. Video
